  "Description":      "Portable Avatar De-multiplexing of the Avatar-Based Videoconference, running continuously: each Portable Avatar is taken as it comes and its parts - the Avatar ID (the nickname), the Avatar (the model and its animation), its Spatial Attitude, the Face and Body Descriptors, the Speech, the Text, the Language Selector, the Entity Personal Status, the scene and the Space-Time - go out, each on the Port of its Data Type, each object with the Avatar ID in its own ID. The model is introduced with the ID at the start and found by the ID afterwards.",
